flowchart TD
    A(["`**SQL Query Input**`"]) --> B
    B["**Query Collection**\nWorkload Collector\nLogs query + metadata"]
    B --> C["**Feature Extraction**\nRuns EXPLAIN\nExtracts 8 features"]
    C --> D["**Candidate Generation**\nnative · NO_INDEX\nHASH_JOIN · NO_BKA"]
    D --> E["**ML Prediction**\nEnsemble model predicts\nlatency per candidate"]
    E --> F["**Uncertainty + Drift Check**\nEnsemble disagreement σ/μ\nPage-Hinkley test"]
    F --> G{"`**SAGE Decision**`"}
    G --> H["**Execution Layer**\nRuns selected SQL\nvia MySQL connector"]
    H --> I["**Feedback Collection**\nRecords actual latency\nRetrains model if buffer ≥ 10"]
    I --> J(["`**Query Results**`"])

